1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,150
Your weekend
doesn't need

2
00:00:01,150 --> 00:00:02,440
another packed schedule.

3
00:00:03,230 --> 00:00:03,960
In Nanxun,

4
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:04,730
look for a stay

5
00:00:04,730 --> 00:00:06,160
with space to slow down.

6
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:07,660
At Oasis,

7
00:00:07,870 --> 00:00:09,400
wooden windows
frame courtyards,

8
00:00:09,530 --> 00:00:10,410
and covered walkways

9
00:00:10,410 --> 00:00:11,670
make the journey
to your room

10
00:00:11,670 --> 00:00:12,680
part of the pause.

11
00:00:13,430 --> 00:00:14,800
Set your bag down.

12
00:00:15,330 --> 00:00:16,680
Leave the laptop closed.

13
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:18,470
Choose a quiet corner

14
00:00:18,470 --> 00:00:19,480
for a cup of tea,

15
00:00:19,690 --> 00:00:20,470
then take your time

16
00:00:20,470 --> 00:00:22,300
