three-course tea ritual.

17
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:24,140
Read a few pages,

18
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:26,020
or simply watch
the light change.

19
00:00:26,790 --> 00:00:27,950
If a private soaking tub

20
00:00:27,950 --> 00:00:28,920
matters to you,

21
00:00:29,030 --> 00:00:29,770
check the room type

22
00:00:29,770 --> 00:00:30,720
