23
00:00:31,550 --> 00:00:32,510
Start the next morning

24
00:00:32,510 --> 00:00:33,340
with breakfast,

25
00:00:33,550 --> 00:00:34,550
then head out to explore

26
00:00:34,550 --> 00:00:35,270
the water town

27
00:00:35,270 --> 00:00:36,320
