31
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:43,740
Just a comfortable room,

32
00:00:43,850 --> 00:00:45,020
a little courtyard time,

33
00:00:45,130 --> 00:00:46,010
and somewhere to return

34
00:00:46,010 --> 00:00:46,900
after wandering.

35
00:00:47,850 --> 00:00:50,340
Save this for
a slower weekend in China.
